       (.m-skeleton[-line/-card/-block/-circle]), pull-to-refresh
       (.m-ptr-indicator/.m-ptr-pill), MobileEditGroup form classes
       (.m-form-card, .m-stat-row). Without this bump browsers keep serving
       the old v2 mobile.css and these new classes render unstyled. *@
